port:8080
name:'no space after the colon'
pool:{min:2,max:16}

----------------------------------------------------

[
	["key", "port"],
	["punctuation", ":"],
	["number", "8080"],

	["key", "name"],
	["punctuation", ":"],
	["string", "'no space after the colon'"],

	["key", "pool"],
	["punctuation", ":"],
	["punctuation", "{"],
	["key", "min"],
	["punctuation", ":"],
	["number", "2"],
	["punctuation", ","],
	["key", "max"],
	["punctuation", ":"],
	["number", "16"],
	["punctuation", "}"]
]

----------------------------------------------------

A key and its `:` have no whitespace between them, and a value may follow the `:` directly.
